OL,3,GNEWSAJury considers verdict in Kieran
OL,4,AHayler rape trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors have begun deliberating in the
OL,7,Ftrial of Katie Price's ex-husband, who
OL,8,Fis accused of raping a 13-year-old
OL,9,Fgirl.
OL,11,FKieran Hayler is on trial at Lewes
OL,12,FCrown Court accused of three counts of
OL,13,Frape and one count of sexual assault of
OL,14,Fthe teenager in West Sussex in 2016.
OL,16,FThe 39-year-old also faces an
OL,17,Falternative four counts of sexual
OL,18,Factivity with a child if the jury
OL,19,Finstead believes there was consent
OL,20,Fbetween the two. He denies all the
OL,21,Fcharges.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
